# macOS screenshots land in the repo root when they are taken here. The name
# carries a narrow no-break space before AM/PM, hence the wildcard.
Screenshot *.png
.DS_Store

# Per-machine tool permissions, not site content. The file says local in its
# own name; it has no business in a repo that is also the deployed site.
.claude/

# The resume export that still carries a home address and phone number in its
# text layer. Kept out of the repo by name so that a routine `git add -A`
# cannot publish it; the redacted export tracks normally as
# dante-smith-resume.pdf.
*-unredacted.pdf
